-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1398671-essay-top-ten-tips-to-running-thin-bloods-in-v5?p=1399152#post1399152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't even know what this means.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now, I even desire more than before read your &quot;heretical&quot; and &quot;unorthodox&quot; guide to the Tremere. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24202-justycar","name":"Justycar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24202_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T03:34:25-07:00","id":1399243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1398671-essay-top-ten-tips-to-running-thin-bloods-in-v5?p=1399122#post1399122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was debating doing the Tremere or Hecata next.<br /> <br /> I planned to do &amp;quot;Ten Tips to use Touchstones&amp;quot; but the reaction to my suggestions here wasn't great.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was just kidding. <br /> <br /> This post was a good one. I think you should keep creating new pol